    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "credit counseling doesnt change the fact that the math just doesnt work. it's not a mistake, it's just the reality of my life. even if i get a \"plan,\" i'll still be working myself to death just to pay for the past. i feel like i'm just existing to pay off people who don't care if i live or die. there's just this heavy feeling that everything is already over for me.",
